<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-NEW SOUTH WALES CHALLENGE FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-NEW SOUTH WALES CHALLENGE FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores from</p>
<p>the New South Wales Challenge golf tournament at the par-72</p>
<p>Terrey Hills course on Thursday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>66 Chris Gray</p>
<p>67 Lucas Parsons, Steve Alker (New Zealand)</p>
<p>68 David Smail (New Zealand), Grant Kenny, Peter Lonard, Peter</p>
<p>Senior, Stuart Bouvier</p>
<p>69 Marcus Wheelhouse (New Zealand), Robert Stephens,</p>
<p>Stephen Allan, Tony Carolan, Tsuyoshi Yoneyama</p>
<p>(Japan), Daniel Motusenko, Ben Jackson (Britain),</p>
<p>Darren Barnes</p>
<p>70 David Hill, Mike Weir (Canada), Robert Allenby, David</p>
<p>Ecob, Stephen Leaney</p>
<p>71 Anthony Painter, Brad King, Nobuhito Sato (Japan),</p>
<p>Simon Owen (New Zealand), Jeff Senior, Leith Wastle,</p>
<p>Lyndsay Stephen, Robert Willis, Darren Cole, David</p>
<p>Bransdon, Michael Harwood, Scott Laycock, Steve</p>
<p>Conran, Jean-Louis Guepy (France), Taichi Teshima</p>
<p>(Japan).</p>
